# Copy to .env.payout (read by npm start). Testnet only.
#
# These are the shared test accounts of the PUBLIC test phrase ("abandon … about"): nothing here is secret, and
# anyone can use (and empty) them. They work as they are, as long as they hold test CCD. To use your own accounts
# instead, put your own testnet seed phrase and its account numbers and addresses here.

# The account that pays out withdrawals (tab 1, up to 50 CCD each), records pledge fingerprints (tab 3) and is
# Example Corp's treasury (tab 5).
PAYOUT_SEED="abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon about"
PAYOUT_ADDRESS=3GEmZc57STNxVqWykUceXAeCVsDzaogq6wNZhDLAV8bRNYzUYd
PAYOUT_PROVIDER_INDEX=0
PAYOUT_IDENTITY_INDEX=899424164

# The account that records each question on chain (tabs 1-3; it needs no CCD), and the account that pays its fee
# (about 5 test CCD per question). Same seed phrase, identity 334563111 with provider 0.
ASK_IDENTITY_INDEX=334563111
ASK_ACCOUNT_NUMBER=13
ASK_ADDRESS=4rEgzrWemrBjxUvkcEkDt9AfB2F7JdS8jkW3M9UWWK1TYaWSX1
SPONSOR_ACCOUNT_NUMBER=11
SPONSOR_ADDRESS=4kJZHvmLwMJjPp58ie7ZZirRkSZL1WLfcKbcrCdBAzweSj9fTU

# The account that holds Example Corp's card (tab 5): set it to the phone's Concordium account.
# CARD_HOLDER=<the phone's account address>
